{"id":"input-8474708adf5f","steamAppId":"424250","name":"Balrum","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/library_600x900.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/424250/","genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"platforms":["windows","mac","linux"],"controllerSupport":"unknown","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":1.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"1 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-8474708adf5f","canonicalId":"steam-app-424250","suppliedName":"Balrum","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/library_600x900.jpg","officialName":"Balrum","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2016,"developers":["Balcony Softworks"],"publishers":["Balcony Softworks"],"platforms":["windows","mac","linux"],"genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"shortDescription":"Balrum is an old-school, turn-based, open world RPG with deep tactical combat. Explore a huge living fantasy world with dozens of side quests next to an epic main quest. Grow your own crops, build your home, and craft your own custom items.","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"424250"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/424250/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T09:57:37.974Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T09:57:37.974Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"424250","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/424250/","officialWebsite":"http://balconyteam.com/","support":"http://balconyteam.com/"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":1,"unit":"GB","display":"1 GB","approximateBytes":1000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 1 GB"},"recommended":{"value":1,"unit":"GB","display":"1 GB","approximateBytes":1000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 1 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":{"value":1,"unit":"GB","display":"1 GB","approximateBytes":1000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 1 GB"},"recommended":{"value":1,"unit":"GB","display":"1 GB","approximateBytes":1000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 1 GB"}},"linux":{"minimum":{"value":1,"unit":"GB","display":"1 GB","approximateBytes":1000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 1 GB"},"recommended":{"value":1,"unit":"GB","display":"1 GB","approximateBytes":1000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 1 GB"}},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"unknown","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"424250","steamName":"Balrum","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/424250/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:13:50.245134+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Balrum is an old-school, turn-based, open world RPG with deep tactical combat. Explore a huge living fantasy world with dozens of side quests next to an epic main quest. Grow your own crops, build your home, and craft your own custom items.","detailedDescription":"CHECK OUT DEEPEST CHAMBER, OUR NEW TITLE!\n\nAbout the Game\n\nBalrum is an old-school, turn-based, open world RPG with deep tactical combat. Explore a huge living fantasy world with dozens of side quests next to an epic main quest. In addition to traditional RPG features Balrum has deep crafting which allows the player to craft their own custom items. Balrum also features farming your own crops, building your home, and survival mechanics complemented by the game's main features. In Balrum you will have a faithful animal companion as your pet. Your pet is fully controllable and adds greatly to the complexity of the combat.\n\nThe player takes control of a young man whose peaceful life is suddenly interrupted by events which will change his life forever.\nFeatures:\n\n• Real-Time world with Turn-Based Combat\n\n• A huge Open World with dozens of Dungeons to explore\n\n• Spend your learning points to create a pure class or a hybrid class\n\n• Dozens of Side Quests and an Epic Main Quest\n\n• Three separate paths leading to the end\n\n• Building\n\n• Farming\n\n• Tame various animals to be your loyal Companion\n\n• Deep Crafting System which allows you to create custom items\n\n• Day/Night Cycle with Weather Effects\n\n• Survival Mechanics\n\nStory\nIt's twenty years after your village fled the kingdom and took refuge in Darkwood. You always knew that these woods hold dark secrets but now you start to feel it's evil on your own skin. Horrible things are happening. You discover fragments of the woods dark history and come to the conclusion that you have to leave your home. You know in your heart that once you step out of the protection of the place where you grown up, nothing will be the same. You have to face a world that's in chaos. A world without laws. Nevertheless you feel something else too. You feel freedom. A completely new world awaits you to explore it, but the feeling quickly turns into guilt. There are people in Darkwood who are counting on your help. You are their last hope.\n\nNOTE: Thank you to all our backers on Kickstarter for making this game possible.","aboutGame":"Balrum is an old-school, turn-based, open world RPG with deep tactical combat. Explore a huge living fantasy world with dozens of side quests next to an epic main quest. In addition to traditional RPG features Balrum has deep crafting which allows the player to craft their own custom items. Balrum also features farming your own crops, building your home, and survival mechanics complemented by the game's main features. In Balrum you will have a faithful animal companion as your pet. Your pet is fully controllable and adds greatly to the complexity of the combat.\n\nThe player takes control of a young man whose peaceful life is suddenly interrupted by events which will change his life forever.\nFeatures:\n\n• Real-Time world with Turn-Based Combat\n\n• A huge Open World with dozens of Dungeons to explore\n\n• Spend your learning points to create a pure class or a hybrid class\n\n• Dozens of Side Quests and an Epic Main Quest\n\n• Three separate paths leading to the end\n\n• Building\n\n• Farming\n\n• Tame various animals to be your loyal Companion\n\n• Deep Crafting System which allows you to create custom items\n\n• Day/Night Cycle with Weather Effects\n\n• Survival Mechanics\n\nStory\nIt's twenty years after your village fled the kingdom and took refuge in Darkwood. You always knew that these woods hold dark secrets but now you start to feel it's evil on your own skin. Horrible things are happening. You discover fragments of the woods dark history and come to the conclusion that you have to leave your home. You know in your heart that once you step out of the protection of the place where you grown up, nothing will be the same. You have to face a world that's in chaos. A world without laws. Nevertheless you feel something else too. You feel freedom. A completely new world awaits you to explore it, but the feeling quickly turns into guilt. There are people in Darkwood who are counting on your help. You are their last hope.\n\nNOTE: Thank you to all our backers on Kickstarter for making this game possible."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/header.jpg?t=1729058860"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729058860"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/ss_d58c2fe5f6f62a3397cf1303ede42b03171cd0c2.600x338.jpg?t=1729058860","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/ss_d58c2fe5f6f62a3397cf1303ede42b03171cd0c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1729058860"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/ss_026f4618437b39e1e66da43801b6124fa91ba04c.600x338.jpg?t=1729058860","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/ss_026f4618437b39e1e66da43801b6124fa91ba04c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1729058860"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/ss_e20e48f73517f6314dfe228756f1b26228413f2d.600x338.jpg?t=1729058860","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/424250/ss_e20e48f73517f6314dfe228756f1b26228413f2d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1729058860"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_